# Modular-Sunburst (CR 702.43a, 702.44c). Arcbound Wanderer ({6}) is paid on turn 1 with Sol Ring ({C}{C}), Black Lotus ({B}{B}{B}) and Mox Ruby ({R}): six mana
# of two colors, so it enters with two +1/+1 counters, a 2/2 (colorless is not a color, and three black mana count once). Suntouched Myr ({3}, sunburst) is cast on
# turn 3 with Sol Ring and Mox Jet: {C}{C}{B}, one color, a 1/1. On turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Wanderer: the counters it had move to an artifact
# creature - the Myr, the only one; Bot2's Balduvian Bears, a creature but no artifact, are not a target, so the ability has one and no choice is asked. The Myr is a 3/3.

